		(descr "IBT-2 / BTS7960 43A H-bridge module, edge-overhang mount. PLACE AT 180 DEGREES: RPWM (pin 2) ends up top-right, GND (pin 7) bottom-left, heatsink toward the board interior. 2x4 2.54mm header, partial module outline, and the two mounting holes that land on the PCB. A=4.00 B=11.00. Board 49.657 x 49.403, M3 holes on 40 mm square.")
